 Botworld over the course of the story-driven single player campaign on your quest to become the world’s greatest Botmaster</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Venture out into a huge open world to discover new bots and collect rare scrap to build them. Deploy your bots in tactical auto-battles on your quest to become the world’s greatest Botmaster.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“A fresh take on the creature-collecting genre that manages to carve out its own identity”<br>Expert Game Reviews<br><br>“A delightful Pokémon-like with a surprising amount of strategic depth”<br>4/5 – Saving Content<br><br>“The perfect creature-collecting game”<br>8/10 – Well Played<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936030/58193d750a376ce202b8d614a299e6ff7ff758bb/header.jpg?t=1767761588", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936030/3df82d284a597479d8e0682724fd8e683d295506/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767761588", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936030/3df82d284a597479d8e0682724fd8e683d295506/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767761588", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-5257U, AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050, AMD RX 460 or equivalent</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Reco